          "slideIndex": 5,
          "title": "Kālidāsa: Kumārasambhavam — The Sovereign Soul of the Himalayas",
          "m4a": "assets/audio/chap5/chapter5s06.m4a",
          "mp3": "assets/audio/chap5/chapter5s06.mp3",
          "sanskrit": "अस्त्युत्तरस्यां दिशि देवतात्मा हिमालयो नाम नगाधिराजः । पूर्वापरौ तोयनिधी वगाह्य स्थितः पृथिव्या इव मानदण्डः ॥",
          "iast": "astyuttarasyāṁ diśi devatātmā himālayo nāma nagādhirājaḥ | pūrvāparau toyanidhī vagāhya sthitaḥ pṛthivyā iva mānadaṇḍaḥ ||",
          "translation": "In the northern quarter stands the divine-souled Himalaya, king of mountains, dipping into the eastern and western oceans, spanning the continents like the measuring rod of the earth."
